OL,3,GNEWSAThe film company that started with
OL,4,A#50 and a camera                       
OL,6,FIn 2001, Jacqui Carroll and Terry Egan 
OL,7,Fstarted a film and documentary company 
OL,8,Ffrom their home with just #50, a       
OL,9,Fdigital video camera and a belief that 
OL,10,Feveryone has a story worth telling.    
OL,12,FNow, a quarter of a century later, the 
OL,13,Fstories captured on film will form part
OL,14,Fof the North West Film Archive.        
OL,16,FREELMCR was set up to help other       
OL,17,Fworking class people gain opportunities
OL,18,Fand experience in an industry that     
OL,19,FJacqui said always felt like it was for
OL,20,Fa "different class".                   
